# Loaded only by `vite --mode soak` (see the `soak` scripts in package.json).
#
# Keeps the window.__speranza inspection hook in an otherwise-production build.
# Long playtests cannot use the dev server: StrictMode double-invokes the tick
# loop there, so 10x speed really runs at ~4.5x. A production build has an
# honest clock but normally strips the hook. This mode gives us both.
#
# Plain `npm run build` does not read this file and still ships without the hook.
VITE_SOAK=1
